"Timesheet date (%(timesheet_date)s) must match attendance date (%(attendance_date)s).\n"
"\n"
"This timesheet is linked to an attendance on %(attendance_date)s (%(check_in)s to %(check_out)s).\n"
"\n"
"Please change the timesheet date to %(attendance_date)s."
msgstr ""
"Data karty pracy (%(timesheet_date)s) musi być zgodna z datą obecności (%(attendance_date)s).\n"
"\n"
"Ta karta pracy jest powiązana z obecnością w dniu %(attendance_date)s (%(check_in)s–%(check_out)s).\n"
"\n"
"Zmień datę karty pracy na %(attendance_date)s."

#. module: hr_attendance_timesheet_project
